      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e4d980ff-eff0-5339-83fe-f482ce75c7e7",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "커뮤니티에 {name} 선수를 겨냥한 글이 쏟아졌다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The community boards are flooded with posts targeting {name}.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f55034f1-157d-5195-81a8-93d22f2e1010",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "신경 안 써요. …안 쓰려고요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I don't care. …I'm trying not to.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "997fb892-3fb6-5982-94e8-3705080e6166",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "사건 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "85d4a4b9-7578-54db-88b1-a6bb954913b8"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "912a2039-ec4c-5736-b420-84f3ced6732d": "incident",
        "9fbe87c1-3740-5736-8f05-b77f1d1e59f0": -1,
        "56593081-cd30-5def-bda9-946bbf2dced3": 0,
        "ca7d4ac4-9f1a-51f6-a58a-89e1fac14fa2": "",
        "97b93896-4717-5b44-8778-b1558c4d8a3b": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "71849509-7e34-5c71-aaf9-132a90055b94",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "18413525-4a03-57b7-861a-7bed201bb0ce",
          "text": "휴대폰은 당분간 내가 맡아 둘게.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "4faa9bef-3878-5cd6-b2a0-f8a78cdf3f21": "ok>trust:+4;ng>trust:-1;ng>pmod:all:-1:1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "6d3f8969-ede7-5429-98f2-f76d1a18a2a2",
          "text": "팀 공식 입장 내자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "4faa9bef-3878-5cd6-b2a0-f8a78cdf3f21": "trust:+3;trust_all:+1;smod:mental:-1:1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "5d1dbc21-89e9-5354-bb2c-b5b863bc493e",
          "text": "실력으로 보여 주면 돼.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "4faa9bef-3878-5cd6-b2a0-f8a78cdf3f21": "ok>pmod:all:+1:-1;ng>pmod:all:-2:1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:18413525-4a03-57b7-861a-7bed201bb0ce": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I'll hold on to your phone for a while.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:6d3f8969-ede7-5429-98f2-f76d1a18a2a2": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Let's put out an official team statement.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:5d1dbc21-89e9-5354-bb2c-b5b863bc493e": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Just prove them wrong with your play.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5d2045ee-d01d-5601-beb8-cd2f72757e9e",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -220.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "오히려 편하네요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Honestly, that's kind of a relief.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "43f56c4a-c341-566d-85a2-d1296cef3d88": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1f95e147-5344-56ca-a886-b882f2f0ef46",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": -220.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "답답해요…",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "This is so frustrating…",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "43f56c4a-c341-566d-85a2-d1296cef3d88": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f3598512-944f-5800-8b74-b2d9ec8eb8bd",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 10,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 40.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "감독님이 막아 주시는 거예요?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You're going to stand up for me?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "83f9802c-6fac-529d-a1fb-154bfbc6caa8",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 11,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 300.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "두고 보세요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Just watch me.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "43f56c4a-c341-566d-85a2-d1296cef3d88": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d42dfa34-099e-55b2-8e85-456aea40d202",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 12,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 300.0,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "그게 쉬우면 이러겠어요?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "If it were that easy, I wouldn't be like this.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "43f56c4a-c341-566d-85a2-d1296cef3d88": "ng"
      }
    }
  ],
